

Shiri sarrafa-ƙwaƙwalwa: 4.

>> i := 0.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], sabon-layi.
{ Fitarwa rubuta: i, sabon-layi. } muddin: { i ƙara: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], sabon-layi.
{ Fitarwa rubuta: i, sabon-layi. } muddin: { i rage: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
